ZE THIS DESTINATION:\nDestination: Switzerland, Switzerland\nTotal Days: 5\nBudget Tier: luxury\nIMPORTANT: Provide realistic budget estimate for Switzerland, Switzerland based on 'luxury' tier in LOCAL CURRENCY.\nUser Interests: food, shopping, relaxation, adventure, photography\n\nUSER REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\n- I want to come back to Zurich on last day to catch flight\n\n=== INSTRUCTIONS ===\n1. First, determine: Is 'Switzerland, Switzerland' a city, state, country, or region?\n2. Set destinationType accordingly: \"city\", \"state\", \"country\", or \"region\"\n3. CITY ALLOCATION RULES:\n   - Small/Medium Cities (e.g., Guwahati, Bruges): 1 city allocation\n   - Large Metropolises with distinct districts (e.g., Hong Kong, Tokyo, NYC):\n     * If duration ≤ 3 days: 1 city allocation\n     * If duration ≥ 4 days: Consider splitting into districts/regions\n       Examples: Hong Kong → 'Hong Kong Island', 'Kowloon', 'Lantau Island'\n                 Tokyo → 'Central Tokyo', 'Western Tokyo', 'Yokohama'\n4. If it's a STATE/COUNTRY/REGION: Return multiple cities based on duration\n5. ESTIMATE REALISTIC BUDGET for this destination based on 'luxury' tier\n\nCRITICAL: If user specifies cities or city count in requirements, RESPECT IT EXACTLY.\n\nExamples:\n- \"Tokyo\" → destinationType: \"city\", 1 city (Tokyo), budget: ¥25,000-40,000/day (luxury)\n- \"Malaysia\" → destinationType: \"country\", 2-3 cities (Kuala Lumpur, Penang, Malacca), budget: RM 300-500/day (luxury)\n- \"Assam\" → destinationType: \"state\", 2-3 cities (Guwahati, Kaziranga, Majuli), budget: ₹3,000-6,000/day (medium)\n\nProvide:\n1. destinationType (city/state/country/region)\n2. budgetEstimate (currency, min/max per person per day, rationale)\n3. List of cities with day allocations\n4. Reason for each city selection\n5. Travel segments between cities (if multi-city)\n6. Highlights for each city\n\n\nRespond with ONLY the JSON, no additional text or formatting:"
